      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milford%2C_Texas",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hudson named the new community Milford after a factory town near Boston he had read about.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
